      "content": "it's just... i'm worried if i fix the center like you said, i'll lose the high ground advantage entirely. i feel like this \"weird\" spread is my only real chance at a surprise attack. are you sure about the risk? honestly, if this is a losing position, i might just restart the scenario instead of wasting more turns.",
